  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Peel and mince garlic. In a large bowl, prepare dressing by whisking together garlic, lemon juice, olive oil, oregano, salt, and pepper."
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and rinse chickpeas. Place on paper towels and pat dry. Add to bowl with dressing and toss to coat."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel, medium dice, and add onion to bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry tomatoes, cucumber, and bell peppers. Medium dice tomatoes and cucumber and add to bowl with chickpeas. Seed, medium dice, and add peppers to bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry parsley. Shave leaves off the stems; discard the stems and mince the leaves. Add to bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add feta to bowl and toss salad."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, place salad in a bowl or on a plate. Enjoy!"
    }
  ]
